src/alac.rs contains a Rust port of Apple's ALAC (Apple Lossless) reference
decoder (ALACDecoder.cpp, ag_dec.c, dp_dec.c, matrix_dec.c from
https://github.com/macosforge/alac), which carries the following notice:

