    See the License for the specific language governing permissions and
    limitations under the License.

The ported code was modified (rewritten in safe Rust, explicit wrapping
arithmetic, bounds/overrun checks, f32 output with WAVE channel order).

The ID3v1 genre table and the G.711 A-law/mu-law expansion follow the
respective public specifications.
